# Seed refinement 11 with 2 fixed points

Count orbital neighbors in a preserved cell of size 1.

For the degree-4060 ATLAS action and the exact zero-based seed in
`SectorGeometry`. Source application: Aschbacher--Smith, printed p.511
(PDF p.528), citing Aschbacher (1986), no.343. Attribution and the inverse
action convention are retained in `Rudvalis.Model.PermutationData`.
The untrusted witness generator is `SeedStabilizer/source/Generate.py`;
every finite assertion below is checked by the Lean kernel.
-/

